+initalize</H3>
+<PRE>
+void <B>initalize</B>(<A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/javax/net/ssl/SSLEngine.html" title="class or interface in javax.net.ssl">SSLEngine</A>&nbsp;sslengine,
