+<DL>
+<DD>Returns <code>true</code> if an HTTP request has been submitted to the
+ target server.
+<P>
+<DD><DL>
+</DL>
+</DD>
+<DD><DL>
+
+<DT><B>Returns:</B><DD><code>true</code> if an HTTP request has been submitted,
+ <code>false</code> otherwise.</DL>
+</DD>
+</DL>
