+failed</H3>
+<PRE>
+void <B>failed</B>(<A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/Exception.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">Exception</A>&nbsp;ex)</PRE>
