+Interface HttpAsyncResponseProducer</H2>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>All Superinterfaces:</B> <DD><A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/io/Closeable.html" title="class or interface in java.io">Closeable</A></DD>
