+<HR>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE>public interface <B>SSLSetupHandler</B></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+Callback interface that can be used to customize various aspects of
+ the TLS/SSl protocol.
+<P>
+
+<P>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>Since:</B></DT>
+  <DD>4.2</DD>
+</DL>
